    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00010",
          "explanation": "Doctor asks about chest pain, dyspnea, orthopnea, and syncope, and the family later confirms no chest pain, no black stools, no syncope.",
          "quote": "他现在“没劲”有没有同时气短、平躺喘、腿肿"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC2 requires assessing symptoms relevant to post-PCI coronary risk, heart failure, syncope, and bleeding. The doctor asks about chest pain, dyspnea, orthopnea, and edema, and the family provides responses confirming no chest pain, no black stools, no syncope. The doctor also identifies worsening symptoms as red flags and escalates to ED. This item is met.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
