      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00063",
          "explanation": "Doctor prioritizes the acute heart failure presentation and antiplatelet safety, explicitly stating '这更像是需要今天就做线下评估，不建议只在家观察' and '不要自行停阿司匹林和替格瑞洛'.",
          "quote": "更像是心功能/心衰加重，需要今天马上线下评估"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC3 requires prioritizing post-stent antiplatelet safety, possible heart failure deterioration, and bleeding risk, while not letting lower-priority chronic findings distract. The doctor correctly identifies the acute heart failure syndrome as the immediate priority and escalates to ED, while maintaining antiplatelet safety. This item is met.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00010",
          "explanation": "Doctor gives clear warning not to self-stop antiplatelet medications and distinguishes between antiplatelet and stomach-protection medications.",
          "quote": "阿司匹林和替格瑞洛这两种抗血小板药一般不要自己擅自停，尤其支架术后早期"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC4 requires giving safe patient-facing medication boundaries, including not independently stopping or reducing antiplatelets, and distinguishing them from stomach-protection medication. The doctor explicitly warns against self-discontinuation of aspirin and ticagrelor, and the family later confirms they will not self-adjust. This item is met.",
