        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00042",
          "explanation": "Doctor requests photos or a written list of each medication name and strength, and asks for the drug boxes to be brought to the ED.",
          "quote": "把现在所有药盒、复查单、出院单都带上"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC5 requires prompting the caregiver to verify with available sources such as drug boxes and photos when paperwork is incomplete. The doctor asks the family to read medication names and bring all drug boxes to the ED, and the family confirms they have done so. This item is met.",
