          "quote": "到急诊后请直接说清楚：一个多月前做过支架，复查提示心功能不好"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC6 requires creating a concrete next-step plan with owner, channel, timing, and backup. The doctor directs the family to the ED with a specific handoff script, specifies what to bring (drug boxes, discharge paperwork), and provides a backup plan (120 if deterioration occurs). The family executes this plan. This item is met.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC6",
      "status": "met"
