        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC8 requires confirming that the caregiver understands the medication safety boundary, knows the next contact step, and can state what information will be gathered. The doctor provides a structured teach-back summary, confirms the caregiver's understanding, and lists unresolved items. This item is met.",
